OL,3,GNEWSABody found in burning van was a
OL,4,Awoman, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FA body found in a burning van has been
OL,7,Fconfirmed as a woman, police have said
OL,8,Fas they continue a murder
OL,9,Finvestigation.
OL,11,FEmergency services had been called to
OL,12,FGas Works Lane in Prestatyn,
OL,13,FDenbighshire, at about 23:30 BST on 4
OL,14,FOctober after reports of a van on fire.
OL,16,FFormal identification is yet to take
OL,17,Fplace, and North Wales Police has asked
OL,18,Ffor the public not to speculate as to
OL,19,Fher identity on social media. The force
OL,20,Fsaid the coroner was being kept
OL,21,Finformed.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
